  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "The company reported revenue of $4,318.6 million for 2023, up 12.7% from $3,832.1 million a year earlier. Operating margin narrowed to 8.45%, and net debt stood at 1.9 times earnings. It carried 27,408,551 passengers on 1,936 trains, of which 91.2% arrived within 5 minutes of schedule. The average fare fell from 64.90 euros to 61.35 euros. The survey, conducted between 3 March and 28 April 2024, drew 10,482 responses; 0.6% were discarded. Readers can call 020 7946 0958 or write to PO Box 1187, quoting reference KX-2024-0719. The report runs to 312 pages and costs 18.50 euros (ISBN 978-3-16-148410-0).",
